<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>have your pic axe out and take a wall with ease. Make sure your picaxe is FULLY out before using. 
Bind to any free key on keyboard and enjoy. :)
NOTE: may not work depending on what ping you have</Description>
